sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as WriterStudio
    participant API as Next.js API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant W as Worker or API run
    participant P as Pipeline
    participant AI as OpenRouter
    UI->>API: POST /api/generation/jobs
    API->>API: Validation, ownership, preflight, active chapter
    API->>DB: Persist or reuse job by idempotencyKey
    API-->>UI: Job id
    Note over UI,API: UI polls every 1.8 seconds while jobs are active
    W->>DB: Conditionally claim QUEUED or RETRYING
    W->>P: Prepare context and prompt
    P->>DB: Read canon, Brief, Scenes, and memory
    P-->>W: Prepared context and prompt
    W->>DB: Save snapshots, prompt, GenerationRun
    W->>P: Execute prepared pipeline
    P->>AI: Generate prose
    AI-->>P: Draft and usage
    P->>P: Normalize and validate Writing Harness
    opt Violations and repair allowed
        P->>AI: One focused repair
        AI-->>P: Repaired draft
    end
    P->>P: Run continuity rules
    P->>AI: Request continuity JSON
    AI-->>P: Model output or request error
    P->>P: Parse and validate; add checker warning on failure
    P->>AI: Extract canon and Brief update
    AI-->>P: Model output or request error
    P->>P: Parse and validate; retain extraction error on failure
    P-->>W: Draft, findings, evaluation, extraction result
    W->>DB: Transaction: save results and READY_FOR_REVIEW
    UI->>API: GET /api/generation/jobs?storyId=...
    API->>DB: Read jobs, draft, and findings
    API-->>UI: Results for review
